7. After flush but before atomic rename.
8. After rename but before Redis token consumption.
9. After Redis token consumption but before HTTP response.
10. During application restart.
11. During concurrent password change.
12. During concurrent password-reset completion.
13. During Redis outage.
14. During filesystem failure.

